      {
        "name": "places/ChIJJU9VA94BBDQRG5sdQSCXR48/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURiMHFucWJnEAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 年前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "豉汁蒸鱔好肥美，蛋白蒸蟹香滑溜，皮脆肉滑炸子雞，不好錯過滷豬手。再來又飲豬肺湯，加個椒鹽瀨尿蝦，味味出色，灣仔一絕。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
